==Battleground==
*8 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*6 [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
*4 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Sanosuke Sagara (Enemy)|Sanosuke Sagara]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
**9 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**6 [[Znache]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**3 [[Zigge]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.

